                        name: "OrgMateBackgroundPictureOptionsUser",
                        displayName: "Background image display method",
                        explainText: 'Sets the display method for the image specified by the Desktop Background Picture setting.\n\nPossible values:\n\n"None" (no);\n\n"Wallpaper" (mosaic) \u2014 duplicates the image in its original size so that the image completely covers the desktop;\n\n"Centered" \u2014 displays the image in the center of the desktop in accordance with the original image size;\n\n"Scaled" \u2014 enlarges the image, maintaining proportions, until the size of one of the image boundaries coincides with the size of one of the screen boundaries;\n\n"Stretched" \u2014 enlarges the image to fit the size of the desktop, changing the proportions if necessary;\n\n"Zoom" (scale) \u2014 enlarges the smallest side of the image until its value coincides with the size of the corresponding screen border; the image can be cropped on the other side;\n\n"Spanned" (fill) \u2014 enlarges the image, maintaining proportions, until the size of one of the image borders coincides with the size of one of the screen borders.\n\nThe "Block" option \u2014 (available only for machine policy) prevents the user from changing this setting. Blocking a policy makes it a priority over a similar policy for the user.',
