                        explainText: 'Set the action performed when you right-click the window title:\n\n"Toggle to header" ("toggle_shade") \u2013 minimize the window to the header. By double-clicking, the window expands back;\n\n"Full screen" ("toggle_maximize") \u2014 expand the window to full screen or restore the original size;\n\n"Stretch vertically" ("toggle_maximize_vertically") \u2014 expand the window vertically without changing its width;\n\n"Stretch horizontally" ("toggle_maximize_vertically") \u2014 expand the window horizontally without changing its height;\n\n"Minimize" \u2014 minimize the window;\n\n"Show menu" ("menu") \u2013 show the window menu;\n\n"Push" ("lower") \u2013 place a window under others;\n\n"Do nothing" ("none") \u2014 do not perform any action;\n\n"Last action" ("last") \u2013 repeat the previous action.\n\nThe "Block" option \u2014 (available only for machine policy) prevents the user from changing this setting. Blocking a policy makes it a priority over a similar policy for the user.',
